## Part 1: Backend Analysis (Roman Urdu)

### 1. Project kya hai

Yeh ek **autonomous market intelligence agent** hai. Aap ek "watchlist" item (topic) banate hain, aur yeh system khud:
1. Research questions banata hai (Planner)
2. Web search karke claims collect karta hai (Researcher)
3. Un claims ko verify karta hai (Verifier)
4. Purani (duplicate) news ko filter karta hai (Dedup)
5. Ek briefing report likhta hai (Writer)
6. Aap ki approval ke baad email karta hai (Deliverer)

Yeh sab ek **LangGraph supervisor + subgraph architecture** ke through chalta hai.

