### 🔵 Agent-Specific Questions

**Q6: Planner agent kaise kaam karta hai?**
**A:** `planner.py` Ollama `llama3.2:3b` model se prompt bhejta hai ke topic ko 3-5 searchable research questions mein todo. JSON array return hoti hai. Temperature 0 use hota hai taake deterministic output aaye.

**Q7: Researcher agent kaise kaam karta hai? Kitne parallel chalte hain?**
**A:** Har researcher ek question leta hai, DuckDuckGo se search karta hai, top 3 results ka content padhta hai, phir LLM se claims extract karta hai. `source_url` programmatically attach hoti hai (LLM se nahi — hallucination rokne ke liye). Har question ke liye ek researcher hota hai, sab parallel chalte hain Send API se.

**Q8: Verifier agent sab se complex kyun hai? Yeh kaise kaam karta hai?**
**A:** Verifier anti-hallucination layer hai. Yeh:
1. Claims ko source URL ke hisaab se group karta hai
2. Har source ka page dobara padhta hai (ya researcher ka cached content use karta hai)
3. Batch mein verify karta hai — LLM se har claim ke liye verdict + confidence leta hai
4. Sirf `confirmed` ya `flagged` + confidence ≥ 0.5 wale pass hote hain
5. `error` verdict hamesha fail (fail-closed)
6. Parallel hai — 4 sources ek saath `ThreadPoolExecutor` se

**Q9: Dedup kaise kaam karta hai? ChromaDB kyun use kiya?**
**A:** ChromaDB ek vector database hai jo semantic similarity se duplicates dhundhta hai. Har claim ka embedding banaya jaata hai, phir top-1 match se cosine similarity check hoti hai. Agar similarity ≥ 0.75 ho to claim duplicate hai aur skip hota hai. ChromaDB isliye kyunki yeh local hai (free), persistent hai, aur cosine distance support karta hai.

**Q10: Writer agent briefing kaise likhta hai?**
**A:** Writer findings ko 2 groups mein todta hai: high confidence (≥0.7) "Confirmed Facts" section mein, aur low confidence (0.5-0.69) "Unconfirmed / Needs Review" section mein. Har claim ke saath "Why it matters" note + source URL hota hai.

**Q11: Deliverer agent kaise kaam karta hai? Email kaise bhejta hai?**
**A:** Deliverer `interrupt()` se pipeline rokta hai aur approval ka wait karta hai. User approve/edit/reject kar sakta hai. Approve hone pe `smtplib` se Gmail SMTP (`smtp.gmail.com:465`, SSL) ke through email bhejta hai. App password se login hota hai.

