### 🔵 Failure / Debugging Questions (from notes.md)

**Q18: Sab se mushkil bug kya tha?**
**A:** Rate-limit errors silently false-pass ban rahe the. Groq ka 429 error aata tha to verifier error ko "flagged" mark kar deta tha — matlab unverified claim briefing mein aa jaata tha. Fix: distinct "error" verdict introduce kiya jo fail-closed hai (hamesha reject). Batching bhi add ki — per-source claims group karke ek LLM call mein verify, 4-5x calls kam.

**Q19: ChromaDB distance metric ki kya problem thi?**
**A:** Chroma default mein squared L2 distance use karta hai, cosine nahi. Humne `1 - distance` se similarity nikalni chahiye thi lekin squared L2 se nikali — result: unrelated claims ko similarity 1.000 mil raha tha. Fix: collection ko `metadata={"hnsw:space": "cosine"}` se banaya, threshold 0.75 pe calibrate kiya.

**Q20: LLM URLs invent kyun karta hai?**
**A:** LLMs "helpful" hain aur jab source URL maango to wo plausible-looking URLs banate hain (hallucination). Fix: URL ko code mein programmatically attach karte hain — search result object se, LLM kabhi URL generate nahi karta.

